*PPD-Adobe: "4.3"
*FormatVersion: "4.3"
*FileVersion: "1.0"
*LanguageVersion: English
*LanguageEncoding: ISOLatin1
*PCFileName: "p800.ppd"
*Manufacturer: "BY"
*Product: "(P800)"
*ModelName: "P800"
*ShortNickName: "BY P800 A4 Thermal"
*NickName: "BY P800 A4 Thermal (ESC/POS raster)"
*1284DeviceID: "MFG:BY;MDL:P800;CMD:ESC;"
*PSVersion: "(3010.000) 0"
*LanguageLevel: "3"
*ColorDevice: False
*DefaultColorSpace: Gray
*FileSystem: False
*Throughput: "1"
*LandscapeOrientation: Plus90
*TTRasterizer: Type42
*cupsVersion: 2.4
*cupsModelNumber: 0
*cupsFilter: "application/vnd.cups-raster 0 rastertop800"

*OpenUI *PageSize/Media Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageSize
*DefaultPageSize: A4
*PageSize A4/A4 (210 x 297 mm): "<</PageSize[595 842]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Letter/Letter (216 x 279 mm): "<</PageSize[612 792]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageSize

*OpenUI *PageRegion/Media Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageRegion
*DefaultPageRegion: A4
*PageRegion A4/A4 (210 x 297 mm): "<</PageSize[595 842]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Letter/Letter (216 x 279 mm): "<</PageSize[612 792]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageRegion

*DefaultImageableArea: A4
*ImageableArea A4/A4: "0 0 595 842"
*ImageableArea Letter/Letter: "0 0 612 792"

*DefaultPaperDimension: A4
*PaperDimension A4/A4: "595 842"
*PaperDimension Letter/Letter: "612 792"

*OpenUI *Resolution/Resolution: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *Resolution
*DefaultResolution: 203dpi
*Resolution 203dpi/203 dpi: "<</HWResolution[203 203]/cupsBitsPerColor 8/cupsColorSpace 0/cupsColorOrder 0>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *Resolution

*OpenUI *ColorModel/Color Model: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *ColorModel
*DefaultColorModel: Gray
*ColorModel Gray/Grayscale: "<</cupsColorSpace 0/cupsColorOrder 0/cupsBitsPerColor 8>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *ColorModel

*OpenUI *P800Mode/Rendering: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 30 AnySetup *P800Mode
*DefaultP800Mode: Dither
*P800Mode Dither/Dither (photos, screenshots): ""
*P800Mode Threshold/Threshold (crisp text, tables): ""
*CloseUI: *P800Mode

*OpenUI *P800Threshold/Threshold Level: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 31 AnySetup *P800Threshold
*DefaultP800Threshold: T160
*P800Threshold T96/Darker text drops out (96): ""
*P800Threshold T128/Normal (128): ""
*P800Threshold T160/Bolder (160): ""
*P800Threshold T192/Boldest (192): ""
*CloseUI: *P800Threshold

*OpenUI *P800Offset/Left Offset: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 32 AnySetup *P800Offset
*DefaultP800Offset: Center
*P800Offset Center/Centered on print head: ""
*P800Offset L0/0 dots: ""
*P800Offset L8/8 dots (1 mm): ""
*P800Offset L16/16 dots (2 mm): ""
*P800Offset L24/24 dots (3 mm): ""
*P800Offset L32/32 dots (4 mm): ""
*P800Offset L40/40 dots (5 mm): ""
*P800Offset L48/48 dots (6 mm): ""
*CloseUI: *P800Offset

*OpenUI *P800Trim/Trim Blank Bottom: Boolean
*OrderDependency: 33 AnySetup *P800Trim
*DefaultP800Trim: True
*P800Trim True/On: ""
*P800Trim False/Off: ""
*CloseUI: *P800Trim

*OpenUI *P800Feed/Feed After Page: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 34 AnySetup *P800Feed
*DefaultP800Feed: Feed6
*P800Feed Feed0/None: ""
*P800Feed Feed6/6 lines: ""
*P800Feed Feed24/24 lines: ""
*P800Feed Feed48/48 lines: ""
*CloseUI: *P800Feed

*DefaultFont: Courier
*% End of p800.ppd
